cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "Falcon_FxP_M4: code for Flying, Not Floating: Precise Fixed-Point Falcon on Embedded Processors"
abstract: >-
  Fixed-point (32.64) FN-DSA / Falcon signing in constant-time
  Cortex-M4 assembly for Falcon-512 and Falcon-1024, with native
  builds and an MPFR-based precision harness. Forked from c-fn-dsa.
authors:
  - family-names: Halmans
    given-names: Stef
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Amit
license-url: "LICENSE"
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://eprint.iacr.org/2026/2431"
    description: "The paper on the IACR ePrint archive"
keywords:
  - FN-DSA
  - Falcon
  - fixed-point arithmetic
  - Cortex-M4
  - post-quantum signatures
